<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CULLINAN WARNS OF HALF YEAR LOSS.</title>
<headline>CULLINAN WARNS OF HALF YEAR LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Cullinan Holdings Ltd said in a cautionary statement on Thursday that its half year results to December 31 would see a &quot;significant&quot; loss.</p>
<p>The firm added it was also finalising several important elements of its operational restructuring and would provide details with its interim figures towards the end of next week.</p>
<p>&quot;Accordingly shareholders are advised to exercise caution in dealing in their shares until the interim statement is published,&quot; the company added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
